// The question kind's steps: the lead's, and the owner's when the lead passes it up.
call answer(ask: Text, context: Text?) -> Answer(text: Text) | Dismiss(why: Text) | Up(why: Text)
  task answer
  template
    A question for you:
    {{ ask }}
    {{ if context }}

    {{ context }}
    {{ end }}

    Answer it; or dismiss it, saying why; or, if only the owner can answer it, pass it up, saying why.

call reply(ask: Text, context: Text?, why: Text) -> Answer(text: Text) | Dismiss(why: Text)
  task answer
  template
    {{ ask }}
    {{ if context }}

    {{ context }}
    {{ end }}

    Passed to you by the lead: {{ why }}
